# @hub-lanes

# ── DAILY FULL CI RUN (BH-4970, slice 3 of BH-4964) ─────────────────────────
# bin/ci-nightly-full.sh — a merge-queue batch runs only its impact set, so once
# a UTC day this starts one FULL harness-ci run on main (from CI_NIGHTLY_FULL_HOUR,
# default 03:17, never while a PR carries merge-queue) and files its red as a
# map gap: one ai-build issue, or a comment on the open one. dispatch is hourly
# so a skipped or failed start retries the same night; collect is hourly.
# Kill: bin/harness-ctl.sh off ci-nightly-full.
17 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/ci-nightly-full.sh dispatch >/dev/null 2>&1
41 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/ci-nightly-full.sh collect >/dev/null 2>&1
